---
import ProductsFigure from './ProductsFigure.astro';
import {engineeringCases} from '../data/cases';
import {caseReading} from '../data/caseReading';
import {photo} from '../data/evidence';
import {siteOrigin} from '../data/seo';
import '../styles/products-20261015.css';
const link=(slug:string)=>'/machined-parts/machining-examples/'+slug+'/',processes=engineeringCases.filter(p=>!p.collection),collections=engineeringCases.filter(p=>p.collection);
const featured=processes.find(p=>p.slug==='two-stage-cnc-milling')!;
const otherProcesses=processes.filter(p=>p!==featured);
const anchors:Record<string,string>={'five-axis-machining-multi-face-parts':'multi-face-access','turning-then-milling-cylindrical-parts':'turning-milling','two-stage-cnc-milling':'two-setups','milling-a-pocketed-enclosure-form':'pockets-and-bores','milling-prismatic-components':'prismatic-parts','29-inch-display-housing-cnc-machining':'display-housing'};
const schema={'@context':'https://schema.org','@type':'ItemList',name:'Six machining examples and two workshop collections',numberOfItems:engineeringCases.length,itemListElement:[...processes,...collections].map((p,i)=>({'@type':'ListItem',position:i+1,name:caseReading[p.slug].title,url:siteOrigin+link(p.slug)}))};
---
<article class="rd-page pd-page"><div class="rd-wrap"><header class="pd-studies-head"><h1>Machining examples</h1><p class="pd-lead">Explore workholding and cutter access in six machining studies, plus separate metal and plastic part collections.</p></header>
 <section id="geometry" aria-label="Six machining examples"><span id="processes-title" class="pd-anchor"/>
  <article class="ps-index-feature ps-index-setup-story" id="two-setups" data-core-section="Two recorded milling operations">
   <header class="ps-index-setup-heading"><h2>One component, two milling operations</h2><div><p>Two operations on one component show the locating references to consider when a part needs repositioning.</p><a class="rd-link" href={link(featured.slug)}>Explore the two-operation study</a></div></header>
   <div class="ps-index-pair">{featured.photos.map((id,i)=><section class="ps-index-setup-view"><h3><span>{i===0?'01':'02'}</span> {i===0?'First recorded operation':'Second recorded operation'}</h3><ProductsFigure {...photo(id)} class={'ps-setup-'+(i+1)} sizes="(max-width:767px) calc(100vw - 80px), (max-width:900px) calc(100vw - 144px), 510px" eager/></section>)}</div>
  </article>
  <div class="ps-index-list" data-core-section="Choose a machining problem">{otherProcesses.map(item=><article id={anchors[item.slug]}><ProductsFigure {...photo(item.video?'display-housing-panel':item.hero)} caption={undefined} origin="original-photo" sizes="(max-width:767px) calc(100vw - 40px), 560px"/><div><a href={link(item.slug)}><h2>{caseReading[item.slug].title}</h2></a><p>{caseReading[item.slug].focus}. Inspection focus: {caseReading[item.slug].inspectionFocus.toLowerCase()}.</p>{item.video&&<p class="pd-small">For a 29-inch display housing, provide the actual enclosure dimensions, stock size and support requirements.</p>}</div></article>)}</div>
 </section>
 <section class="rd-section" id="part-families" data-core-section="Choose a material collection"><header><h2>Metal and plastic part collections</h2><p>The plastic and metal collections contain separate component forms. Each part in an order needs its own material grade, drawing revision and test requirements.</p></header><div class="ps-collection-grid">{collections.map(item=><article><ProductsFigure {...photo(item.collection==='metal'?'metal-aluminum-close':'plastic-ptfe-shafts')} caption="Original photo" origin="original-photo"/><div><a href={link(item.slug)}><h3>{item.collection==='metal'?'Metal part forms':'Plastic part forms'}</h3></a><p>{caseReading[item.slug].focus}.</p></div></article>)}</div></section>
 <section class="rd-section pd-end" data-core-section="Drawing review and quotation"><div><h2>Discuss a similar component</h2><p>Send the current drawing, exact material, quantity and the feature relationships that control fit.</p></div><div id="prepare-rfq"><a class="rd-button" href={'/quote/?'+new URLSearchParams({part:'Machining study drawing review',source:Astro.url.pathname}).toString()}>Request a quote</a><p class="pd-small">Leave your name, destination country and contact details. Include the drawing or a question if available.</p></div></section>
 </div></article><script is:inline type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(schema).replace(/</g,'\\u003c')}/>
